        "id": 1054754
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-06-21T23:17:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "yes, gPreloadFds \u003d\u003d nullptr would mean that we did not call MarkOpenedFilesBeforePreload. I wanted to put an assert/CHECK here, but was not sure of the best way to do it. Would RuntimeAbort(env, __LINE__, message) be appropriate here?",
      "parentUuid": "5f1b9316_ad23a8cb",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2562,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 2562,
        "endChar": 15
      },
      "revId": "ed10978de1dda9abc85c1736e2ffbc3d995cb03c",
